# * with evidence on one side only (a first record with no predecessor
#   of its own, or a tail record nothing points back at), that side's
#   unique owner attributes the row;
# * one-side sets that genuinely disagree attribute nothing; such a row
#   falls through to the stored ownership column below, same as a row
#   with no surviving link evidence.
